cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets or scripts, please cite the associated paper."
title: "UFU-Do53-EXF and UFU-DoH-EXF"
type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: "Borges"
    given-names: "Cristiano L. M."
  - family-names: "Miani"
    given-names: "Rodrigo S."

abstract: >-
  UFU-Do53-EXF and UFU-DoH-EXF are complementary datasets designed
  for detecting data exfiltration over conventional DNS and DNS over
  HTTPS. The repository includes structured CSV data, packet captures,
  PCAP-to-Flow processing scripts, and supervised machine-learning
  baseline experiments.

repository-code: "https://github.com/CborgesUFU/DNS-360-Dataset"

keywords:
  - DNS
  - DNS over HTTPS
  - DoH
  - data exfiltration
  - DNS tunneling
  - cybersecurity
  - network security
  - machine learning
  - packet capture
  - dataset

